Package: TSGenerator
Title: The TSGenerator package has been created with the aim of facilitating time series extraction of HRVPP data from Copernicus for users with different levels of R programming.
Version: 1.0.0.2025
Authors@R: 
    person("Alexey", "Valero", , "avalero@cita-aragon.es", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5993-7346"))
Description: Time series generator of High Resolution Vegetation Productivity and Phenology data from the Copernicus program: 1) Vegetation Indices (NDVI, PPI, LAI, fAPAR and the quality product QFLAG); Seasonal trajectories of the PPI and 3) Parameters of productivity and phenology of the vegetation.
